     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " pulmonary hypertension, mitral stenosis, pulmonary embolism, chronic lung disease (cor pulmonale), congenital heart disease (e.g., tetralogy of Fallot, pulmonary stenosis), arrhythmogenic right ventricular cardiomyopathy"
